### trapping signal number 8
trap on_fpe 8
>>> SC2172 1:13

### trapping the exit pseudo-signal 0
trap cleanup 0
>>> none

### trapping portable number 14
trap on_alarm 14
>>> none

### leading double dash disables the signal checks
trap -- on_fpe 8
>>> none

### leading -p disables the signal checks
trap -p 8
>>> none
